.MARINE...
(Today through Tuesday)
Issued at 1032 AM PDT Thu Sep 24 2026

Light to moderate northerly breezes expected through early
Thursday night. Building high pressure in wake of a passing cold
front will usher in fresh to strong breezes Friday into Saturday
for most of the waters. Near gale force gusts will be possible in
the wind-prone areas nearshore. The stronger winds will lead to an
elevated sea state and hazardous conditions for small craft.

